SEL-0 · Develop room commission surface — HELD, NOT APPLIED

This is the writer-facing half of the SEL-0 selector: the door the writer opens
to ask MAIA what is worth looking at, the single observation offered, and the
'what else?' that advances within one commission.

IT IS NOT APPLIED TO THE TREE, and that is deliberate. The design-canon gate
requires an Experience Contract for any member-facing surface, with two
screenshots on disk and an account of a real experience walk. Neither could be
produced without fabricating evidence, so the surface is held here instead of
shipped without a contract, and instead of being deleted.

To take it up: write the Develop room's Experience Contract (nearest sibling
docs/design/contracts/structure-review.md), walk the gesture against a real
reading, capture desktop and mobile, then apply this patch.

  git apply docs/programme/sel-0/SEL-0_DEVELOP_ROOM_SURFACE.patch

-----------------------------------------------------------------------

